            "originalText": "7B) Fluxo Pontual\n\nBotao concluir -> POST\n/api/todos/[id]/complete-pontual\nUseCase completePontual:\n- valida tipo pontual\n- impede concluir 2x\n- cria TodoLog\n- seta lastCompletedDate/At",
            "autoResize": true,
            "lineHeight": 1.25
